<title>INDIA: India cuts customs duty on nickel, ferroalloys.</title>
<headline>India cuts customs duty on nickel, ferroalloys.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India on Friday cut customs duty on nickel in the 1997/98 (April-March) budget to 10 percent from 20 percent in the previous year.</p>
<p>Finance Minister P. Chidambaram in his budget presented to parliament reduced customs duty on ferroalloys to 20 percent from 25 percent.</p>
</text>
